# ── TEMPLATE — committed to git on purpose (contains no real key) ───────────
#
# To enable the Claude LLM features, copy this file to `llm-secret.properties`
# in the SAME folder and replace the value with a real Anthropic API key:
#
#   PowerShell:  Copy-Item llm-secret.properties.example llm-secret.properties
#   then edit `anthropic.api.key` below.
#
# `llm-secret.properties` is gitignored — it is never committed or pushed.
#
# WITHOUT a key the pipeline still runs fully on the deterministic rule-based
# parser; the money conformance suite, Claims regression pack, data layer and
# all of `mvn test` pass with no key. Only the Claude-backed features need one:
#   - the `/api/llm/*` endpoints (normalize / translate / narrate / fix / explain)
#   - the "Claude API" option in the frontend NL-parser dropdown
#
anthropic.api.key=sk-ant-REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-OWN-ANTHROPIC-KEY
